              "noDataMessage": "No storage IOPS metrics. Confirm Azure Monitor Agent (AMA) and a Data Collection Rule (DCR) collecting `LogicalDisk(*)`, `Cluster CSV File System(*)` or `Cluster Shared Volume(*)` `Disk Transfers/sec` counters (or VM Insights `InsightsMetrics`) are deployed to the cluster nodes — expand the Performance Counter DCR Configuration section above for setup guidance.",
